{
  "texts": [
    "1. Acceptance of the Terms",
    "By accessing and using Yamilook, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you must not use our service.",
    "2. Description of the Service",
    "Yamilook is a social communication platform that allows users to:",
    "Send and receive text, voice and media messages",
    "Make voice and video calls",
    "Share statuses and posts",
    "Connect with other users",
    "Participate in groups and communities",
    "3. Eligibility",
    "To use Yamilook, you must be at least 13 years old. By using our service, you represent and warrant that you are of legal age to enter into a binding contract and are not prohibited from using the service under applicable laws.",
    "4. User Account",
    "You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account and password. You agree to accept responsibility for all activities that occur under your account. You must notify us immediately of any unauthorized use of your account.",
    "5. User Conduct",
    "You agree not to:",
    "Use the service for illegal or unauthorized purposes",
    "Publish offensive, defamatory or harmful content",
    "Harass, threaten or intimidate other users",
    "Share spam or misleading content",
    "Attempt to access other users' accounts",
    "Interfere with or disrupt the operation of the service",
    "Infringe third parties' intellectual property rights",
    "6. User Content",
    "You retain ownership of all content you publish on Yamilook. By publishing content, you grant us a worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free license to use, reproduce and display that content in connection with the service.",
    "7. Intellectual Property",
    "The Yamilook service, including its design, logos, software and all content created by us, is protected by copyright, trademarks and other intellectual property laws.",
    "8. Limitation of Liability",
    "Yamilook is provided \"as is\" without warranties of any kind. We will not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special or consequential damages arising from the use of, or inability to use, the service.",
    "9. Changes to the Service",
    "We reserve the right to modify or discontinue the service at any time, with or without prior notice. We will not be liable to you or third parties for any modification, suspension or discontinuation of the service.",
    "10. Termination",
    "We may terminate or suspend your account and access to the service immediately, without prior notice, for any reason, including violation of these Terms of Service.",
    "11. Applicable Law",
    "These terms shall be governed by and interpreted in accordance with applicable laws, without regard to their conflict-of-law provisions.",
    "12. Contact",
    "If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, contact us by email at: suporte@yamilook.com",
    "Terms of Service",
    "1. Introduction",
    "Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how Yamilook collects, uses, stores and protects your personal information when you use our service.",
    "2. Information We Collect",
    "We collect the following types of information:",
    "2.1 Account Information",
    "Username and display name",
    "Email address",
    "Telephone number (optional)",
    "Profile photo",
    "Biographical information",
    "2.2 User Content",
    "Messages sent and received",
    "Photos, videos and other shared files",
    "Posts and comments",
    "Statuses and stories",
    "2.3 Usage Information",
    "Login and activity data",
    "Device information",
    "IP address",
    "Preferences and settings",
    "3. How We Use Your Information",
    "We use your information to:",
    "Provide and maintain our service",
    "Personalize your experience",
    "Process and deliver messages",
    "Improve and develop new features",
    "Ensure platform security",
    "Communicate important updates",
    "Comply with legal obligations",
    "4. Sharing Information",
    "We may share your information with:",
    "Other users according to your privacy settings",
    "Service providers who help us operate the service",
    "Legal authorities when required by law",
    "Business partners with your consent",
    "We do not sell your personal information to third parties.",
    "5. Storage and Security",
    "We implement technical and organizational security measures to protect your information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure or destruction. Your messages are encrypted in transit and at rest.",
    "6. Data Retention",
    "We retain your information for as long as necessary to provide the service or as required by law. You can request deletion of your account and data at any time through the application settings.",
    "7. Your Rights",
    "You have the right to:",
    "Access your personal information",
    "Correct inaccurate data",
    "Request deletion of your data",
    "Export your data",
    "Withdraw consent at any time",
    "Lodge a complaint with a data protection authority",
    "8. Cookies and Similar Technologies",
    "We use cookies and similar technologies to improve your experience, remember your preferences and analyze how our service is used. You can manage your cookie preferences through your browser settings.",
    "9. Minors",
    "Our service is not intended for children under 13. We do not knowingly collect children's personal information. If we discover that we have collected information from a minor, we will take steps to delete that information.",
    "10. International Transfers",
    "Your information may be transferred to and stored on servers located outside your country of residence. We ensure that these transfers comply with applicable data protection laws.",
    "11. Changes to this Policy",
    "We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. We will notify you of any significant changes through the application or by email. Continued use of the service after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.",
    "12. Contact",
    "If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your information, contact us:",
    "Email: privacidade@yamilook.com",
    "Support: suporte@yamilook.com",
    "Privacy Policy",
    "Back",
    "Last updated: January 12, 2026",
    "By continuing, you accept our",
    "Terms of Service",
    "and",
    "Privacy Policy"
